paragraph\" >Automate extraction over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend ever deeper into the cavern</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/f0beb0e05178657cde168d89d7325d51.poster.avif?t=1770048678\" width=630 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/f0beb0e05178657cde168d89d7325d51.webm?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/f0beb0e05178657cde168d89d7325d51.mp4?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade, Automate, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert mined <strong>iron into gold</strong>, invest in better <strong>drills</strong>, <strong>auto-miners</strong>, and <strong>smelters</strong>, and build an unstoppable mining machine that runs even while you're away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade pushes you further \u2014 from iron to <strong>rare metals</strong>, <strong>thermal drills</strong>, and fully automated mining rigs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate repetitive tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your income flow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/96dc6e94acbfb8c217c26beec9334ddf.poster.avif?t=1770048678\" width=582 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/96dc6e94acbfb8c217c26beec9334ddf.webm?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/96dc6e94acbfb8c217c26beec9334ddf.mp4?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smelt, Refine, and Optimize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t just mine \u2014 <strong>process</strong>.<br>Unlock <strong>smelters</strong> to refine raw materials into higher-value metals. Turn ore into currency. Turn currency into power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined materials unlock <strong>new tech trees</strong> and <strong>deeper progression layers</strong>, rewarding careful planning and automation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smelt ores into advanced materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new mechanics through refined goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your processing chains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/347720aab74d030e1610a1dab8708d8f.poster.avif?t=1770048678\" width=462 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/347720aab74d030e1610a1dab8708d8f.webm?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/347720aab74d030e1610a1dab8708d8f.mp4?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend Deeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress isn\u2019t just numbers \u2014 it\u2019s <strong>depth</strong>.<br>Each descent layer unlocks <strong>new challenges</strong>, <strong>resource types</strong>, and <strong>gameplay systems</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend rubble to tunnel further into the earth, unveiling secrets, boosts, and environmental hazards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through to new depths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover layer-based content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the procedural underworld</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/ec75bca17c699f9e4146796050cfb46b.poster.avif?t=1770048678\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/ec75bca17c699f9e4146796050cfb46b.webm?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/extras/ec75bca17c699f9e4146796050cfb46b.mp4?t=1770048678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for the Terminal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget flashy graphics. Terminal Descent embraces <strong>pure ASCII charm</strong>, letting your imagination and efficiency drive the experience.<br>Whether you're actively clicking or letting your systems run in the background, the <strong>minimalist aesthetic</strong> delivers both nostalgia and focus.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal-style interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASCII graphics, carefully animated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works in a terminal window</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle or Active \u2014 You Choose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your pace. Want to actively mine, manage upgrades, and optimize strategy? Go for it.<br>Prefer to leave it running in the background while you work? The automation systems have you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal Descent</strong> blends the best of <strong>idle games</strong> and <strong>active incremental gameplay</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for short sessions or long idle runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Systems evolve over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying exponential progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Roxicaro"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923210/3e2e280490b7fb23ec80569c87b4b0c0061deb82/header.jpg?t=1770048678","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Icaro Alves Pinto. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3923210/654319899/c7cb89975f7452c7ab36e13078da5f41d2d56c64/1755360603/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755428702","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3923210/654319899/c7cb89975f7452c7ab36e13078da5f41d2d56c64/1755360603/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755428702","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3923210/654319899/c7cb89975f7452c7ab36e13078da5f41d2d56c64/1755360603/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755428702","id":257184113,"name":"Terminal Descent Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184113/df37e33ce944628ea263f1b4787385375255a4d5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755428702"}],"name":"Terminal Descent","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 GHz processor (x86/x64)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Potato friendly</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Roxicaro"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descr